WEBVTT

00:11:28.958 --> 00:11:31.434
DB: Just say "of course" again?
Allan: Of course.

00:11:31.458 --> 00:11:34.559
DB: Alright. If it's a word --
I imagine it's a word, right --

00:11:34.583 --> 00:11:36.768
just see the password
written in front of you,

00:11:36.792 --> 00:11:38.684
big clear block capital letters,

00:11:38.708 --> 00:11:42.809
and as you look at it, think for me
of a letter somewhere in the middle,

00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:44.351
don't say it out loud,

00:11:44.375 --> 00:11:46.851
just get a letter in your head
that's in the middle.

00:11:46.875 --> 00:11:48.309
Have you got one?
Allan: Yeah.

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:49.842
DB: OK, stick with that for me.

00:11:50.875 --> 00:11:53.268
Ah, you changed it, OK.

00:11:53.292 --> 00:11:54.684
You changed your mind there.

00:11:54.708 --> 00:11:56.000
I think you settled on a --

00:11:56.833 --> 00:11:58.333
I think that's a "B", yes?

00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:00.375
Allan: No.